    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n83993" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Πλουτώνιον</span></b> , τό, any
		place <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>where there are mephitic
				vapours,</i> looked upon as entrances to the nether world,
				<i><span class="en">
				Str.
				5.4.5
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				13.4.14
			</span></i>; but <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Πλουτώνειον</span></b> ,
				<i>temple of Pluto,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				IG
				4.203.20
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Corinth</span>):—<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Πλουτωνίς</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ίδος</span>, ἡ,
				<i>Persephone,</i> Orac. ap. <i><span class="en">
				Phleg.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				36.10J.
			</span></i>; also <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Πλουτώνη</span></b> ,
				ἡ, <i><span class="en">
				Orph.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				200
			</span></i>.</div>
